			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740350201,
					"content": "Traveler, glad to see you've come back for another visit. Coffee?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350202,
						740350203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350202,
					"content": "Now that you mention it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350204,
					"content": "Yeah! Paimon wanted to ask too, but... But those guys were so loud, and Paimon didn't dare talk about anything else...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350243,
					"content": "And I thought I was going to be kicked out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350205,
					"content": "Why? Hahaha, no need to worry! The guards let you in, so why would we take it upon ourselves to chase you out?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350206,
					"content": "This is also an example of clear delegation of authority and responsibility. Hello, Traveler. I am Semaine, it is a pleasure to meet you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350207,
						740350208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Semaine"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350207,
					"content": "Hello.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350209,
					"content": "Semaine used to work in the courts as an assistant secretary. Due to some... rather messy circumstances, he was transferred back to the Maison Gestion.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350210,
					"content": "Using his logical and precise deductions, we were able to find solutions to many previously intractable problems.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350211,
					"content": "Please, that's a bit much. I merely transferred over my previous work experience, and used the value of certain things to infer the importance of matters related to them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Semaine"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350212,
					"content": "Though in practice, countless matters that cannot be precisely measured will crop up in the course of work. But in these cases, applying Roialte's well-developed axioms of human interaction is of great assistance.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Semaine"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350213,
					"content": "And that means... what now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350214,
					"content": "Put simply, when dealing with work, Semaine is quite skilled in considering all sides and their state, and makes everyone feel like they are important. It's like balancing scales.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350215,
					"content": "And if the balancing act is simply impossible, then I can tip the scales with the \"weight of words.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350216,
						740350217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350216,
					"content": "Iaune sure seems to be working hard...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350218,
					"content": "Yeah! It seems like he's about to pass out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350219,
					"content": "This is a path that all must walk, sooner or later. Should I help Iaune write the document, he will not remember this lesson.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350220,
					"content": "His head and heart are filled with idealistic fantasies about what working in the Maison Gestion is. But fantasies are for the young, not for Gestionnaires.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350221,
					"content": "And I simply don't know how to write those documents.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Semaine"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350222,
					"content": "You're quite direct...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350223
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350223,
					"content": "Alright, so what business brings you here? Tell me, and I'll see if I can...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350224,
					"content": "Iaune suddenly runs over in a panic...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350225,
					"content": "Alas! All is doom and ruin! ...Mr. Roialte, do you have spare keycaps for the typewriter?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iaune"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350226,
					"content": "As I was typing, I suddenly discovered that a keycap was missing, I have no idea when it could have...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iaune"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350227,
					"content": "Did you already have a look nearby? Maybe it just fell off onto the ground.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350228,
					"content": "Or maybe it's stuck in a book, or sandwiched between documents... Did you already check these possibilities?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Semaine"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350229,
					"content": "Or maybe it's in a pen holder. Or your sleeve.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350230,
					"content": "Or your hair, or in a teacup!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350231,
					"content": "I've looked everywhere! Even my pockets and my shoe bottoms, I've searched all over, and it's nowhere to be found!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iaune"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350232,
					"content": "Very well. Then you should go ask Cornelia. If we do have spares for things like keycaps, then she's the one you need to file a request with.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350233,
					"content": "I should just go buy one myself! It shouldn't take Estelle long at all to make a keycap.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iaune"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350234,
					"content": "My dear Iaune, do you really want to spend your own money? The typewriter and its keycaps are public property, and the property of the Maison Gestion. Filing an application with Cornelia is the proper procedure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Roialte"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350235,
					"content": "It really doesn't cost much at all...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iaune"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350236,
					"content": "This is not a matter of how much. This is another matter of authority and responsibility.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Semaine"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350237,
					"content": "Repairing the public property of the Maison Gestion should be paid for by the public accounts of the Maison Gestion!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Semaine"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350238,
					"content": "If you pay for this with your private funds, and do not file a claim for reimbursement, then when expenses are audited at the end of the year, it will be unclear where the money came from!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Semaine"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350239,
					"content": "Fine! Fine! I'll go find Cornelia right now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350240,
						740350241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iaune"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350240,
					"content": "Even buying something is such a pain...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350242
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350242,
					"content": "This is actually quite normal around here. Please, this way. Let's go find Cornelia.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Iaune"
				},
				{
					"id": 740350241,
					"content": "Is even paying for things this annoying...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350242
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350217,
					"content": "Can you help him?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350208,
					"content": "And you are...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740350203,
					"content": "Why were none of you surprised to see me here before?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740350204
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
